resume.md/preferences.md/hard_filters.md — corrections here override the
general rubric when they conflict, since they're calibrated against your
actual right/wrong feedback.

Format: one bullet per correction, newest at the bottom, plain language.
Do not delete old entries even if a newer one narrows them — the history is
part of what makes future calibration sessions useful.
